# Topic branches merged into quattro and stacked into asus/stack, in this order.
# <branch> <kind> <draft>
#   kind: pr     = written to be opened on omacom/omarchy as it is
#         carry  = someone else's open upstream pull request, carried until it merges
#         fork   = stays in the fork (model-specific policy, or upstream said no)
#   draft: the pull request text under fork/prs/
# A branch whose commits upstream already has is reported by fork/sync and can be removed here.
#
# Package and kernel changes live in rdoupe-omarchy/omarchy-asus-pkgs (drafts here as fork/prs/pkgs-*.md):
#   nvidia-open-x86_64               NVIDIA #1299, #1412 and #1368 for x86_64 nvidia-open-dkms
#   linux-omarchy-hid-asus-winlock   hid-asus Win-lock pass-through in linux-omarchy
#   omarchy-settings-source-monitor  ship the charger-swap monitor unit (companion to asus/usbc-power)
#   omarchy-settings-nvidia-powerd   ship the nvidia-powerd start-limit drop-in (companion to asus/nvidia-powerd-start-limit)
#   omarchy-asus                     upstream master with every companion above merged in; install and test from this one

